{"id":"101634","t":{"th":null,"ro":"BanG Dream! 3rd Season","en":"BanG Dream! 3rd Season","na":"BanG Dream! 3rd Season"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101634-4PSQAU2bw7s3.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101634-4PSQAU2bw7s3.png","color":"#d61a1a","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101634-sgjYum7n666i.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":13,"dur":24,"season":"WINTER","year":2020,"start":"2020-01-23","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Music","Slice of Life"],"score":79,"pop":16898,"studio":"SANZIGEN","desc":"The girls of Poppin'Party have come a long way, but the competition coming up is the biggest yet - the BanG Dream! Girls Band challenge at the legendary Budokan! Slots to compete are limited and the usual competitors will be vying for the chance, but the band to beat is the new RAISE A SUILEN, whose founder, Chiyu, has sworn to destroy both Roselia and Poppin'Party!\n\nIndeed, Chiyu's main goal is to make Roselia's lead Yukina pay for denying Chiyu a spot as a producer, and the musical prodigy has the connections and resources to push the competition up to the next level! Can Poppin'Party keep up with the increased tempo and meet challenges like producing their own music video? They'll have to if they want to make it to the big show!","descTh":"สาวๆ จาก Poppin'Party มาไกลมาก แต่การแข่งขันที่กำลังจะมาถึงคือการแข่งขันที่ยิ่งใหญ่ที่สุด - BanG Dream! Girls Band ท้าดวลที่บูโดกันระดับตำนาน! ช่องสำหรับแข่งขันนั้นมีจำกัด และผู้เข้าแข่งขันตามปกติจะต้องแย่งชิงโอกาสนี้ แต่วงดนตรีที่จะเอาชนะได้คือ RAISE A SUILEN ใหม่ ซึ่งผู้ก่อตั้ง Chiyu ได้สาบานว่าจะทำลายทั้ง Roselia และ Poppin'Party!\n\nแท้จริงแล้ว เป้าหมายหลักของ Chiyu คือการทำให้ Yukina ผู้นำของ Roselia ยอมจ่ายเงินสำหรับการปฏิเสธ Chiyu ในฐานะโปรดิวเซอร์ และผู้มีความสามารถทางดนตรีคนนี้มีความเชื่อมโยงและทรัพยากรที่จะผลักดันการแข่งขันขึ้นไปอีกระดับ! Poppin'Party สามารถตามจังหวะที่เพิ่มขึ้นและเผชิญกับความท้าทายเช่นการผลิตมิวสิกวิดีโอของตัวเองได้หรือไม่? พวกเขาจะต้องทำหากต้องการไปชมรายการใหญ่!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"dXVz7SHu6Rs","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/101634","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/37870","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"bilibili","r":"TH","u":"https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347026",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a22tm567qxnce9i3j0ubjsnct.jpg",null,{}],["2","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347027",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a23olkb1avgwex41zbjg6m208.jpg",null,{}],["3","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347028",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a22pyblwnv42pty1yzpw8prve.jpg",null,{}],["4","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347029",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a23ex79e6nmy64htlc57stcp8.jpg",null,{}],["5","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347030",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a2r8tcdjxpaicq3rfqran5vnu.jpg",null,{}],["6","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347031",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a21gj8m7nq9ojjv39z46pafcu.jpg",null,{}],["7","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347032",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a21qlnhk8f1irrh31cweyon8f.jpg",null,{}],["8","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347033",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a216axk59pcxidg938rx1hu40.jpg",null,{}],["9","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347034",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a23ge4x4vxrmpnu17ty4uy5za.jpg",null,{}],["10","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347035",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a22bvnhx4s5auty2151r7ybos.jpg",null,{}],["11","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347036",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a2155jruobkl4ux2jjtaukf7c.jpg",null,{}],["12","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347037",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a21yyiw62573s9v9r4e6jy8it.jpg",null,{}],["13","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/34937/347038",1605685680,"x","b:m201017a2lhv3mf2dfzwa21pdulhizwi.jpg",null,{"fin":1}]]},{"p":"muse_asia","r":"ASIA","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl19k-OS